  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure one of six beautifully crafted family homes in this boutique Orewa development by Mars Living Construction.\r\n\r\nOffering a selection of thoughtfully designed floorplans, each home has its own unique character while sharing the same commitment to quality, comfort, and family-focused living. Whether you prefer the kitchen and main living area upstairs to capture elevated views, or a layout with the kitchen downstairs and enhanced multi-generational flexibility, there is an option to suit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAll homes feature 5 generous bedrooms, 3 to 3.5 bathrooms, double internal access garaging, spacious outdoor areas, and premium specifications throughout.\r\n\r\nChoose from two distinct layout styles:\r\n\r\nOption 1 – Family Flexibility\r\nThe kitchen, dining, and main living area are located downstairs, creating an easy connection to everyday family living. A downstairs bedroom with its own ensuite provides an ideal space for grandparents, guests, teenagers, or a home office. Upstairs, a spacious second living room opens through large sliding doors to a beautifully landscaped backyard, creating a unique indoor-outdoor living experience.\r\n\r\nOption 2 – Elevated Living & Views\r\nDesigned to maximise outlook and natural light, the kitchen and dining area are positioned upstairs, enjoying pleasant views and seamless access to a balcony through large sliding doors. The spacious upstairs living area also connects directly to a landscaped backyard, creating an impressive entertaining space that is rarely found in modern homes.\r\n\r\nAcross the development, every home offers:\r\n\r\n• 5 bedrooms and 3–3.5 bathrooms\r\n• Multiple living areas for flexible family living\r\n• Landscaped outdoor entertaining areas\r\n• Beautiful balconies with elevated outlooks\r\n• Premium central air-conditioning with individual room controls\r\n• Quality kitchen appliances and finishes\r\n• Double internal access garage\r\n• Generous family-friendly floorplans\r\n• Quality construction by Mars Living Construction\r\n• Move-in ready homes available now\r\n\r\nWith only a limited number available and each home offering its own unique layout and advantages, this is an opportunity to find the perfect fit for your family's lifestyle.\r\n\r\nContact Lisa today for a full information pack or to arrange a private tour of the available homes.",
